---
---
<section class="hero-section section-padding">
  <div class="container hero-container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="badge">TURMA 8 • INSCRIÇÕES ABERTAS</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        CHEGOU SUA HORA DE <span class="text-glow highlight-blue">VIVER DE ATENDIMENTOS</span> E SE TORNAR UM NUTRICIONISTA AVANÇADO
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Tudo o que você precisa para viver de consultório em uma única formação: do raciocínio clínico avançado à captação automática de pacientes.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta-wrapper">
        <a href="#oferta" class="btn-shiny hero-btn">Garantir minha vaga agora</a>
        <div class="hero-guarantee">
          <span class="tag-item">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="svg-subtle"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            Garantia Incondicional de 7 Dias
          </span>
          <span class="tag-item">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="svg-subtle"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
            Acesso Imediato
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-video-wrapper">
      <div class="glass-panel video-panel">
        <div class="video-container">
          <!-- Placeholder de vídeo premium -->
          <div class="video-overlay">
            <button class="play-btn" aria-label="Assistir vídeo de apresentação">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="play-icon">
                <path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/>
              </svg>
            </button>
            <p class="video-label">ASSISTA AO VÍDEO DE APRESENTAÇÃO</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 140px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-size: 4.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .highlight-blue {
    color: var(--accent-glow);
  }
  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    max-width: 560px;
  }
  .hero-btn {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .hero-guarantee {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .tag-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .svg-subtle {
    color: var(--accent-glow);
  }
  .video-panel {
    padding: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border-radius: 32px;
  }
  .video-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0A1325, #050B14);
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }
  .video-overlay {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .play-btn {
    width: 88px;
    height: 88px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent-blue);
    border: none;
    color: white;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.6);
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  .play-btn:hover {
    transform: scale(1.1);
    background: var(--accent-glow);
    box-shadow: 0 0 50px var(--accent-glow);
  }
  .play-icon {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    margin-left: 6px;
  }
  .video-label {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }
  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .hero-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 56px;
    }
    .hero-subtitle {
      margin: 0 auto 40px auto;
    }
    .hero-guarantee {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 576px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 3rem;
    }
    .hero-guarantee {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
